# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# app.json sets web.output: "static", so Expo pre-renders one HTML file per
# known route. Dynamic routes cannot be pre-rendered — there is no way to know
# every parcel id at build time — so /parcel/abc123 has no file of its own and
# Pages would answer 404.
#
# Cloudflare serves a matching file first and only falls through to these rules,
# so this catches the dynamic routes without shadowing the pre-rendered pages.
# Status 200 rather than 301: the browser keeps the original URL, which is what
# lets expo-router read the id out of it.
#
# Expo copies everything in public/ to the root of the export.
/*    /index.html    200
